{"at": "2026-11-20T19:25:53.204657+00:00", "event_id": "01M7X6R8NMA18HFWBGQ6BJ1Z50", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M7X6R1QSXNTY0X64GQWWTZVZ", "final_answer": "Operator rulings 2026-11-20 (binding): (1) strict accept gate reads the implementer from status/review_roles; (2) the API claim records agent=--actor through the shared claim-sidecar builder, also API transition --to claimed and agent status emit --to claimed; (3) a canceled WP with no claim history needs no implementer, never fabricated; (4) the repair hint names a command that works from that state, derived from the state machine, else no hint, and a test runs it; (5) fold #5818: accept-mission uses the provenance-aware acceptable-ending predicate; (6) fold #7644: API --to planned releases the claim slots; (7) #7752 only if a shared canceled helper falls out (it does not); (8) #5782 sequenced after.", "mission_id": "01M7X6Q6YGMSTAD3BFKB7QD7VW", "mission_slug": "api-claim-accept-readiness-01M7X6Q6", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-20T19:25:53.204657Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M7X6R1QSXNTY0X64GQWWTZVZ", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-20T19:25:53.203818Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
